Subject: [PATCH] Common target for config app generation and parsing

---
 vanadium/android_config/common/BUILD.gn              | 12 ++++++++++++
 .../src/app/vanadium/config/common/Constants.java    |  9 +++++++++
 2 files changed, 21 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 vanadium/android_config/common/BUILD.gn
